    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A song. A psalm of the descendants of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "On the holy mountain",
          "stands the city founded by the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He loves the city of Jerusalem",
          "more than any other city in Israel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "O city of God,",
          "what glorious things are said of you!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Interlude"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will count Egypt and Babylon among those who know me—",
          "also Philistia and Tyre, and even distant Ethiopia.",
          "They have all become citizens of Jerusalem!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Regarding Jerusalem it will be said,",
          "“Everyone enjoys the rights of citizenship there.”",
          "And the Most High will personally bless this city."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When the Lord registers the nations, he will say,",
          "“They have all become citizens of Jerusalem.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Interlude"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The people will play flutes and sing,",
          "“The source of my life springs from Jerusalem!”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
